                  <p className="text-sm md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4 text-gray-700">In 2024, nearly 18% of unsecured loan borrowers in India engaged in settlement discussions with major lenders, discovering that settlement waivers are not fixed but highly negotiable based on verified financial hardship. Understanding the exact HDFC Bank settlement waiver percentage can be the difference between paying 80% of your outstanding debt and securing a resolution at 30%.</p>
